  {
   "id": "cpp",
   "title": "⬇ 下载 C++ 实战套件（最大子段和）",
   "html": "<div class=\"box tip\"><div class=\"box-title\"><span class=\"ic\">技</span>怎么用</div><p>把下面的 4 个文件存到同一文件夹，编译 <code>g++ gen.cpp -o gen</code> 等同理，双击 <code>run.bat</code> 即可在本机对拍。把 <code>my.cpp</code> 换成你自己的 C++ 解法，<code>std.cpp</code> 是可靠标程。</p></div>    <div class=\"dl-kit\">\n      <button class=\"btn sm\" onclick=\"dlKit('cpp-seq-gen','seq_gen.cpp')\">下载 gen.cpp</button>\n      <button class=\"btn sm\" onclick=\"dlKit('cpp-seq-std','seq_std.cpp')\">下载 std.cpp</button>\n      <button class=\"btn sm\" onclick=\"dlKit('cpp-seq-my','seq_my.cpp')\">下载 my.cpp</button>\n      <button class=\"btn sm\" onclick=\"dlKit('cpp-seq-bat','seq_run.bat')\">下载 run.bat</button>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"cb-bar\"><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><button class=\"copy-btn\">复制</button></div><div class=\"code-scroll\"><table class=\"hl\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"ln\">1</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">// seq_gen.cpp：生成随机输入，写到 seq.in</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">2</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">#include &lt;bits/stdc++.h&gt;</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">3</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">using namespace std;</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">4</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">int main(){</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">5</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">    srand(time(0));</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">6</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">    int n = 1 + rand() % 8;                 // 小数据更易暴露 bug</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">7</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">    printf(&quot;%d\\n&quot;, n);</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">8</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">    for(int i=0;i&lt;n;i++) printf(&quot;%d%c&quot;, -10 + rand() % 21, &quot; \\n&quot;[i==n-1]);</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">9</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">    return 0;</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">10</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">}</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"cb-bar\"><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><button class=\"copy-btn\">复制</button></div><div class=\"code-scroll\"><table class=\"hl\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"ln\">1</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">// seq_std.cpp：暴力标程 O(n^2)，一定正确</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">2</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">#include &lt;bits/stdc++.h&gt;</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">3</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">using namespace std;</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">4</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">int main(){</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">5</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">    int n; cin &gt;&gt; n; vector&lt;int&gt; a(n); for(int i=0;i&lt;n;i++) cin &gt;&gt; a[i];</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">6</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">    long long best = -1e18, s = 0;</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">7</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">    for(int i=0;i&lt;n;i++){ s = 0; for(int j=i;j&lt;n;j++){ s += a[j]; best = max(best, s); } }</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">8</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">    cout &lt;&lt; best &lt;&lt; endl;</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">9</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">    return 0;</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">10</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">}</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"cb-bar\"><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><button class=\"copy-btn\">复制</button></div><div class=\"code-scroll\"><table class=\"hl\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"ln\">1</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">// seq_my.cpp：你的 Kadane 解法（替换成你自己的实现去对拍）</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">2</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">#include &lt;bits/stdc++.h&gt;</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">3</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">using namespace std;</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">4</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">int main(){</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">5</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">    freopen(&quot;seq.in&quot;,&quot;r&quot;,stdin); freopen(&quot;seq.out&quot;,&quot;w&quot;,stdout);</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">6</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">    int n; cin &gt;&gt; n; vector&lt;int&gt; a(n); for(int i=0;i&lt;n;i++) cin &gt;&gt; a[i];</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">7</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">    long long best = -1e18, cur = 0;</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">8</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">    for(int i=0;i&lt;n;i++){ cur = max((long long)a[i], cur + a[i]); best = max(best, cur); }</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">9</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">    cout &lt;&lt; best &lt;&lt; endl;</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">10</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">    return 0;</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">11</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">}</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"cb-bar\"><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><button class=\"copy-btn\">复制</button></div><div class=\"code-scroll\"><table class=\"hl\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"ln\">1</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">@echo off</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">2</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">:loop</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">3</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">  gen.exe &gt; seq.in</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">4</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">  std.exe &lt; seq.in &gt; std.out</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">5</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">  my.exe  &lt; seq.in &gt; my.out</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">6</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">  fc std.out my.out &gt; nul</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">7</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">  if errorlevel 1 (echo WA!! &amp; pause) else (echo AC &amp; goto loop)</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>",
   "text": "技 怎么用 把下面的 4 个文件存到同一文件夹，编译 g++ gen.cpp -o gen 等同理，双击 run.bat 即可在本机对拍。把 my.cpp 换成你自己的 C++ 解法， std.cpp 是可靠标程。 下载 gen.cpp 下载 std.cpp 下载 my.cpp 下载 run.bat C++ 复制 1 // seq_gen.cpp：生成随机输入，写到 seq.in 2 #include <bits/stdc++.h> 3 using namespace std; 4 int main(){ 5 srand(time(0)); 6 int n = 1 + rand() % 8; // 小数据更易暴露 bug 7 printf(\"%d\\n\", n); 8 for(int i=0;i<n;i++) printf(\"%d%c\", -10 + rand() % 21, \" \\n\"[i==n-1]); 9 return 0; 10 } C++ 复制 1 // seq_std.cpp：暴力标程 O(n^2)，一定正确 2 #include <bits/stdc++.h> 3 usin"
